<</Type/StructElem/Alt(The Sotheby\342\200\231s International Realty\302\256\nbrand\342\200\231s newly released 2026 Mid-Year\nLuxury Outlook\302\256 Report provides insights\ninto the trends and developments affecting\nthe global luxury real estate market, which\ncontinues to maintain its strength and\noutperform the general housing market.1\nStill, there are nuances in luxury real\nestate to explore.\nAt Sotheby\342\200\231s International Realty, we\nare seeing the buyer pools for the high-end\nmarket continue to diversify. We see new\nhomebuyers enter the market because\nof\302\240the rise of intergenerational wealth\ntransfers, as well as homebuyers who\ncontinue to benefit from the extraordinary\nwealth creation generated by stock market\ninvestments and escalating real estate)/P 55 0 R/K[3542 0 R]/Pg 12 0 R/S/Figure>>
endobj

