<</Type/StructElem/Alt(\nThere\342\200\231s a push and\npull, with different\nseasons in life that draw\npeople to own homes\nin various places.)/P 55 0 R/K[3546 0 R]/Pg 12 0 R/S/Figure>>
endobj

