2905 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/Alt(Travel as an Indicator\nfor Second Home Markets\nLuxury travel trends can also provide insights into the\nmotivations and priorities of those looking into high-\nend real estate purchases. \342\200\234Affluent travelers place\na\302\240premium on experiences where they feel completely\ncared for,\342\200\235 White says. \342\200\234That\342\200\231s one reason branded\nresidences continue to be among the hottest trends\nin\302\240luxury real estate. People really gravitate to places\nlike\302\240the St. Regis, Four Seasons and Waldorf Astoria\nresidences because they like living in\302\240a place that\nprovides\302\240the services of a luxury hotel. Asia-based\nbranded residence operators such as Mandarin\nOriental,\302\240The Peninsula, Banyan Tree, Six Senses\nand\302\240Rosewood are setting new standards of luxury.\342\200\235\nIn addition, a willingness to spend lavishly on\ntravel\302\240bodes well for continued investment in real estate,\nespecially as people find new destinations where they\nmay\302\240want a more permanent residence.\n\342\200\234Affluent travelers, made wealthier in recent years\nby\302\240stock-market rallies and real-estate gains, have\nsplurged on their stays with abandon,\342\200\235 according to\na\302\240November 2025 report by The Wall Street Journal.13\n\342\200\234Having already accumulated a stash of fancy cars and)/P 55 0 R/K[3632 0 R]/Pg 24 0 R/S/Figure>>
endobj

2906 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/Alt(watches, wealthy Americans today are spending even\nmore on experiences, including travel. Multigenerational\ntrips are more popular than in the past, with grandparents\npaying for accommodations large enough to include their\nchildren and grandchildren.\342\200\235\nLifestyle Drives Sales\n\342\200\234We have a lot of momentum in our brokerages and\nour\302\240affiliate businesses,\342\200\235 White says. \342\200\234We anticipate\nthe\302\240resilience of the luxury real estate market to continue\nthroughout this year and beyond.\342\200\235 In addition, trends\nsuch\302\240as lifestyle-driven priorities and the influence\nof\302\240younger wealthy homebuyers are likely to affect global\nhigh-end property markets throughout the year.\nThe combination of wealth creation through real\nestate, equity investments and intergenerational transfers\nsupports continued resilience in luxury and ultra-luxury\nhousing markets. Ultra-high-net-worth homebuyers and\nsellers share an understanding that investing in real estate\nfor lifestyle benefits and financial diversification could help\ngenerate their preferred outcomes. Still,\302\240they seek the\nadvice of real estate experts with global\302\240networks and\nexpertise to help them navigate the\302\240complexities of\nproperty purchases. \342\226\240)/P 55 0 R/K[3633 0 R]/Pg 24 0 R/S/Figure>>
endobj

