<</Type/StructElem/Alt(\nArtificial intelligence has triggered\na renaissance for the Bay Area.\n\n\n\n\n\nALEX HACHIYA, senior global real estate advisor, Sotheby\342\200\231s International Realty - San Francisco Brokerage)/P 55 0 R/K[3655 0 R]/Pg 27 0 R/S/Figure>>
