<</Type/StructElem/Alt(The assumption that luxury property owners will\neventually transition into luxury senior living or retirement\ncommunities is no longer certain. Fahmi points out that\nmultigenerational living is on the rise among affluent\nfamilies as a way to accommodate aging relatives u)/P 55 0 R/K[3750 0 R]/Pg 35 0 R/S/Figure>>
